___NOTES___

This template:
1. Sets default consent states (all denied except functionality_storage)
2. Reads existing _cnsnt cookie and updates consent if found
3. Loads the cookie banner script from the specified URL

The cookie banner will:
- Show if no consent cookie exists
- Update consent via dataLayer when user makes a choice
- Remain hidden if consent cookie already exists

Default script URL: /cookie-consent.js
(can be changed in tag configuration to use CDN or different path)
